{"metas":[{"id":"cine_3147728","slug":"cinemana-3147728","type":"series","name":"Shinja Zero","poster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/0EB1EC30-0AE6-D272-8F7D-3BD9D2297756_poster.png","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/0EB1EC30-0AE6-D272-8F7D-3BD9D2297756_poster.png","landscapePoster":"https://cnth2.shabakaty.cc/vascin-poster-images/0EB1EC30-0AE6-D272-8F7D-3BD9D2297756_poster.png","description":"بعد انتقاله إلى عالم خيالي برفقة زملائه، يكتشف تاكاتسوكي ماكوتو أن قدراته ضعيفة للغاية، وأن أمامه عشر سنوات فقط ليعيشها. يلتقي بالإلهة نوا التي لا تملك أي أتباع، ويصبح أول مؤمن بها. وبفضل بركاتها، ينطلق ماكوتو في مغامرة خطيرة لتطوير قدراته ومساعدة إلهته\n\nAfter being transported to a fantasy world with his classmates, Takatsuki Makoto discovers that his abilities are extremely weak and that he has only ten years to live. He encounters Noah, a goddess with no followers, and becomes her first believer. With her blessings, Makoto embarks on a dangerous adventure to grow stronger and help his goddess.","releaseInfo":"2026","imdbRating":"6.4","genres":["رسوم متحركة | Animation","خيالي | Fantasy","رومانسي | Romance"]},{"id":"3isk_watch__episodes__serie-tuzlu-kahve-season-1-episode-12","type":"series","name":"مسلسل القهوة المالحة الحلقة 12","poster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iXgalcTI4nBc4Dw0Ef4LevCz1Qp.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iXgalcTI4nBc4Dw0Ef4LevCz1Qp.jpg","landscapePoster":"https://3iskk.xyz/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/iXgalcTI4nBc4Dw0Ef4LevCz1Qp.jpg","logo":"https://3esk.onl/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/3isk-logo.png","description":"مسلسل القهوة المالحة الحلقة 12 — 3isk (قصة عشق)"},{"id":"alooy_bsnw38ujnbfv","type":"series","name":"ورود وذنوب ج2 مدبلج","poster":"https://ga.alooytv16.xyz/uploads/video_thumb/2012.jpg","posterShape":"poster","background":"https://ga.alooytv16.xyz/uploads/video_thumb/2012.jpg","landscapePoster":"https:/